DESCRIPTION:Extraordinary Alien. A Jewish actress and mum from Leeds moves 
 to New York on her husband’s visa – then loses her status overnight. Wi
 th no choice but to apply for an “extraordinary ability” visa\, she mus
 t prove she’s exceptional. Cue characters\, chaos\, dodgy accents and a f
 ull-blown identity crisis. From kids and culture clashes to ego\, guilt and
  the desperate need to be seen as enough\, she spirals across two continent
 s. Fast\, fierce and unapologetically funny\, this is a no-holds-barred sol
 o-show about ambition\, impostor syndrome and never quite fitting in – no
  matter where you land.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/ev
 ent/extraordinary-alien/
